(7786803, 1290153, 36065, '<td valign="top">
<b>Hey there from the Critique Club</b>
<br/>
<br/><b>My thoughts on the image:</b> I cannot understand how this did not ribbon.  This one should have placed third, at least in my opinion.  Everything about the image works together to pull my into and all around it.  Fantastic capture!
<br/>
<br/><b>My ideas for improvement: </b> I may have upped the vibrance, especially on the blue, just a bit, but that would have probably been all that I would have done differently.
<br/>
<br/><b>Where I would have/did score this entry:</b> I didn''t vote, but this would have been an 8 from me.  I think that the 1 and 2 finishers would have pulled 9s from me, but this would have been an easy 8.  Great image!
<br/>
<br/>Thank you for the opportunity to provide a critique on your entry,
<br/><b>Eric</b>
<br/></td>', 'Hey there from the Critique Club

My thoughts on the image: I cannot understand how this did not ribbon.  This one should have placed third, at least in my opinion.  Everything about the image works together to pull my into and all around it.  Fantastic capture!

My ideas for improvement:  I may have upped the vibrance, especially on the blue, just a bit, but that would have probably been all that I would have done differently.

Where I would have/did score this entry: I didn''t vote, but this would have been an 8 from me.  I think that the 1 and 2 finishers would have pulled 9s from me, but this would have been an easy 8.  Great image!

Thank you for the opportunity to provide a critique on your entry,
Eric', '2025-08-11 11:51:56.000000', NULL, 0);
